--- !u!1001 &1347687308
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2042843277735502377, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Interactable Letter
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'November 9th 1927


        Why were we called for this? Can the police
        not handle a simple missing person case?


        I mean, if they want federal
        agents to handle it we will, that''s what we''re here for.



        I don''t
        know why we had to bring the old librarian along for this though.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: 'Acting like he''s the only one qualified to find this guy.


        Guys
        like him tick me off.


        I almost hope we don''t find anyone so I
        can rub it in his face.


'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.data[2]
      value: 'Well anyways, We''ll search the missing guy''s house and see what we
        can find.


        With any luck he''ll be back to his wife and kids within
        the week.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9066643239372199602, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 3.5961716
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
